    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You are blessed by the Lady’s spirit, enabling you to resist magical attacks and extend that resistance to nearby allies. You and affected allies gain the Magic Resistance (2) Creature Trait. For every +2 SL you may increase the Magic Resistance effectiveness by 1. Spells cast from the Lore of the Grail are unaffected by this spell’s effect.</p><p><strong>Lore:</strong> Grail magics use the lore effects and ingredients of your Troth Wind (Azyr, Ghur, or Ghyran). See @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-nom.nom-journals.JournalEntry.szhETavVooj84NXa.JournalEntryPage.n0mJrnlLoreGrail]{Lore of the Grail}.</p>"
